<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="h">Corinthiame Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Corinthiame Dage raukegai laisiu Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Corinthiame Keraibe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Cor.</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Corinthiame dage raukegai laisiu Keraibe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiu aide Paul ne Corinth ga kebam ngqwa dage raugai, AD 55 dau. Pa Ephesus ga kebam dau pa Corinthiame ngqwa dade laisiu ngau kelude keli kegai tei eh raugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mediterranean kung ga kebam, Corinth namdi aide makehei heliketei bam ge. Cide kenggwak namdi ge nah cide ziemne Rome deu pelane gade keci nam ge. Corinth cika ngqwabe keheci ge cune cika Khristianme penuide twagwa kebammedung nzwa lu lama, cine ngqwabe pe kenaangdung ge bamla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Corinth ga Khristianme hangge gede ngngwa yi lama-penui lam tsam dila. Midungge mau süt eh lunghla. Paul penuide kesiugai kerane nah dainzwa Khristianme lunghlu maisiabi ledeu gai kerane laisiu aide raugai. Pa Khristianme teilung maikesia samdung ledeu gai iciu eh Corinth ga minadung kesiabe gade keyibe ci ntsamlu kerane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelumkegai nah kenggai (1:1-9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngqwa ga pangkepop (1:10-4:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kemmha ta nah hetuketiak (5:1-6:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Laktak (7:1-40)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khristianme ziuyi nah penui tadung (8:1-11:1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Hemaabe ga Khristianme (11:2-34)</para>
  <para style="io1">Rabe mapeudung kenlang (12:1-14:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista ringcuhkecu nah kenlummedung (15:1-58)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kekambe (16:1-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Paul, Tinggwang lungning gade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang lungning gade: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina kengkieng ne ma. </char></note> Khrista Jisu ne langkegaibe zielie qu kelube, nah anui sinabe Sosthenes ne raupwa, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Corinth ga Tinggwang ngqwabe, Khrista Jisu gade tei mci kelume, kehei gade anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi de, penui nah anui Rampaube lie qu kelame de ngngwa kemcime tei zielie qukelume dage kekai. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Peu anui Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugia nah lungciep de nnui da bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenggai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Tinggwang ngaugia Khrista Jisu zi gade nnuide kepeu de ziemne, Ih a Tinggwang de nnui ziemne twa bam muila. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kedanemene pa ne ma pelane ga nnuide tei mahei beu dida, kerang nah maci leune gade de, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Khrista ha zierang de nnui kakga kesang lie kecu keulia mcigai da, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />cine nnui anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista cailigwang kera kwa sünne eh kebam ga nnui rabe kilam mapeudung magede kegah tei meda, <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Khrista nnuide penli ga kecang teingkieng beuzie, iciu eh peu nnuide anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista cailikegwang tingba benai mmaugai kelakme teilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Tinggwang nnuide pe Na, anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista kekangbau gage qugai kelube au masang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Hez. 7:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Cu sinamedung, anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi gade, Ih nnui dage kie gaila, nnui pelane kesamdaulwe nnui kakga peu pemaa ketsam bam so, dede nnuide lungcet ket nah kakegai ket gage keriangkeu ncüt lulo. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Kedanemene a sinamedung, Chloe kilungme nnui kakga kesamlim bam lalie kecu nnui ha acu paubeu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Cu Ih aide de rang kebam au, nnui hangge ge kecu ainzwa rang kelane, “Ih au Paul caisui la”, mede “Ih au Apollos caisui la” mede “Ih au Cephas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peter zi keda ge cai Cephas.</char></note> caisui la” mede “Ih au Khrista caisui la.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Khrista de mzi tsam pwa bamni? Paul de nnui ziemne gwaktset dini? Mede nnui Paul zi gade duipum teilu dini? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Ih Crispus penai Gaius de gwale nnui migede de duipum tei kemakne Ih Tinggwang de twala, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />cine migede a zi gade duipum teilu lie kecu rang daulak. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Ih Stephanas kilungme dede duipum teida. Ci gwale, Ih kedame de duipum ketei ci meda.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kedanemene Khrista acu duipum tei kerane langgai ma, dede samliakeyibe rang kerane—nah maci sam teu ranglo ma, mecai Khrista krus de pe kengkieng kemta teidi zielu.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista au Tinggwang maci nah kengkieng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Kedanemene kapdi laizeu kecume ziemne au krus samde au kemta sam ge, dede anui kelikelume ziemne au, cide Tinggwang kengkieng. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Kedanemene Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa raupwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Ih makecime maci de teingkap dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">nah Ih kemriakme maci de keugi dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa. 29:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Daiga makecibe bam no? Daiga laisiukebe bam no? Daiga aipau kideu ga sam rang renia kelabe bam no? Tinggwang kideube maci de tei kemie sam teidi meluini?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:22">Rom. 1:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Tinggwang pe maci gade kideube mina maci gade pecu cigai kelak ngau delwe pa anui kemie samkerang de teu nlum kelume de kelilu kera cetlu. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Kedanemene Jewme miswakegah bata rehidung kiela nah Greekme maci peeila. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Dede anui au Khrista de gwak kedibe ha rangla, cide Jewme ziemne puikaam ge nah Gentileme ziemne kemie sam ge. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Dede Jewme de nah Greekme de, kelikelu gage qukelumedung ziemne au, Khrista au Tinggwang kengkieng nah Tinggwang maci lie. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Kedanemene Tinggwang kemie au mina maci swa mteuki, nah Tinggwang kemnei au mina kengkieng swa ngkiengki.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Cine nnuide kelikelu gage qugai kelude cet gailo sinamedung, pumteih zai rehi gade cai nnui mina kekiee ge ma kecime ma, kekiee ge ngkieng ma, nah kekiee ge kelak keyi gade lunghlu ma. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Dede Tinggwang kecime de tei ngngam gai kerane kideu ga kemiemedung de kedetlu, nah Tinggwang kengkiengme de tei ngngam gai kerane kideu ga kemneime de kedetlu. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Tinggwang kideu ga hena nah nneu kelame de, nah magede lie kemakme de kedetlu, iciu eh yi lie kelabe de magede kemak tei dilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />Cine migede Tinggwang dwade ngang daulak. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Dede pe ziemne, nnui Khrista Jisu de ngngwa ncüt luda, nah Tinggwang peu pecu anui maci, anui masang nah anuide teimcikelube nah rikelube tei luda, <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />ciziemne Kesanglaisiu ga raupwakela nzwa, “Peu hegie kelabe de Rampaube ziemne hegie lulo.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer. 9:24</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 10:17">2 Cor. 10:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ih nnuida kegwang dau, sinamedung, Ih sam kedi mede maci teu Tinggwang zierang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang zierang </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tinggwang kengkim kesang.</char></note> tei gwang ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Kedanemene Ih nnui kakga kebam dau, Jisu Khrista nah pecu gwak kedi ha gwale ma kedage de cilu kera Ih cet ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Ih pumteih mnei, nah ngngi, nah mbeusüt eh nnuide ngngwa bam. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />A sam nah a samrangdung au rangkeci maci samdung gade ma, dede Tinggwang Rabe nah kengkieng keulia kegai sam, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />iciu eh peu nnui kenlum mina maci ga bamdi mene Tinggwang kengkieng ga bamlu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rabe dade maci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Cu anui ngkieng kedime kakga maci sam rangla, dede cide aipau kideu, mede aipau kideu kedimedung gahdi kezeume maci ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Meliene, anui Tinggwang maci kebai teukela macetkecok de rangla, cide Tinggwang kideu teikemak dwade anui kendu ziemne mrairiem pwala. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Kideu aika kedimedung migede maci cide cilu ma, kedanemene penui cide cilu liecai, kendu Rampaube de penui gwak dilak nage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:27">Bat. 13:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Dede Kesanglaisiu ga raupwa kela nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Mimiak gede ngau kemak de,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mimiak gede ngau kemak de: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie migede Tinggwang ne pe mina ziemne pekemlang nah hezu keyi tei kegai de ngau mci mede cicang ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">nah mikwen gade siu kemak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">nah mina lung gade cetla kemakde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">ma aidungde Tinggwang pecu ku kelame ziemne mtei teula.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa. 64:4</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 65:16">65:16</ref> </char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Tinggwang pe Rabe gade cidungde anuide keulia dida. Kedanemene Rabe maleu peeila, Tinggwang mariem kecokdung kecang de. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Kedanemene mina kakga cauge mi kedage lungning cilu lano, pe rabe pe lungga kela dene gwale? Cinzwa eh Tinggwang Rabe gwale migede Tinggwang lungning cima.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:27">Mac. 20:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Nah anui kideube rabe ngau luma, dede Tinggwang dade kegwang Rabe de ngaulu, iciu eh Tinggwang anuide mta kepeudungde anui cilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Nah anui ma aidungde, mina ne ledeu kebeu maci samdung gade rangla ma, dede Rabe ne ledeu kebeu sam gade rangla, rabe samdung teu rabe kesang hadung rang mcigai kerane. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Dede Rabe peda kegahme Tinggwang Rabe mapeudung ngaulu lama, kedanemene pe ziemne cidungde au kemta ge. Pa cidungde ci gailak kedanemene cidungde au rabe kilamde cilu kela lu. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Rabe kebambe au ma pelane ci lula, dede mide pecu cilu lama.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Kesanglaisiu rangkela nzwa, “Kedanemene cau Rampaube lungning ci no—caune pecu ledeu lai?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa. 40:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Dede anui au Khrista lungcetbe bam.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Ngqwa ga pangpop kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Sinamedung, Ih nnui dage rabe kebamme dage nzwa marang gailakdi, dede pumteihbe minadung nzwa, Khrista gade henamedung dage nzwa marangla. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Ih nnuide ketyeipok kengkiengbe mene, tungdui sak kera pwa peu, kedanemene cide ziemne nnui mtei lu mereulu. Kesang, cude, nnui mtei lu mereu, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />nnui au cude pumteihbe reu kecune. Kedanemene nnui kakga mide ngau miriak kecu nah kengaurau kecu kebam ga, nnui pumteihbe meni nah mina zaibe nzwa tetla melui ni? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Nnui mige, “Ih Paul caisui la,” nah kedage, “Ih Apollos caisui la,” de kerang dau, nnui kideube mina meni? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Ciucai Apollos cau no? Nah Paul cau no? Penai au nnuide nlumkelu gage ngngwa gai kebeu kilame ge, Rampaube hangge ge kecu de teilo kebeu tade teila. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Ih ne linggai, Apollos dui ketaugai, dede Tinggwang ne tei mlung beu. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Cine, ling kegaibe mede dui ketau kegaibe au magede ma, dede tei mlung kegaibe au Tinggwang. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Cu ling kegaibe nah dui ketau kegaibe au ket, nah mige ge kecu pekatei peta rehi gade pe ziehi ngau zie. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Kedanemene anai au Tinggwang ziemne ngngwa bata tei kelame. Nnui au Tinggwang luh nah Tinggwang ki.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Tinggwang ngaugia acu kepeu gade Ih ki tei kecibe nzwa pe bangdwa dwalu, nah mina kedage cipau reu gade tei cuhla. Dede keheibe de sünne eh cipau reu gage teilu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Kedanemene migede pe bangdwa kenzeu de gwale kedage de dwasi gailak lu, cide au, Jisu Khrista.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Cu keheibe de kecak, rangkanggeu, tangtsu pemi kehung, tsing, reigau, mede tanggai teu eh pe bangdwa dwa kenzeu gage teicai, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />hangge ge bata de mi miakngau tei zie, kedanemene Khrista tingba benai cide liagai zie, nah cide mi gade keuliagai zie kecune. Keheibe de bata daikenzwa ge teipwa bambi kecu mi gade kedak pie zie. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Mige bata de mi gade tei msiadi mene bam lucai, pa ziehi ge ngau luzie; <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />dede mige bata de ru nggah dicai, pa kap dizie, dede pecu au pa mi gade mbaikelu nzwa kelilu zie.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Nnui au Tinggwang kerecaki lie kecu nah Tinggwang Rabe nnuida lunghbam lie kecu nnui ci meni? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Keheibe de Tinggwang kerecaki tei msia dicai, Tinggwang cipaude de tei msia dizie. Kedanemene Tinggwang kerecaki au mci, nah nnui cide da.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Peu migede de pekatei pecu cwa diso. Nnui kakga mige pekatei pecu le pwane cudau teilung gade maci lie lacai, peu pecu ma kecime ge teilu kerane pecu “kemieme” ge tei dilu. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Kedanemene aipau kideube maci au Tinggwang dwade kemta ge. Kedanemene Kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa raupwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:19">“Pa makecime de penui ciem gade tui lula.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Job 5:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Nah pecaide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:20">“Rampaube au makecime lungcetdung au kemta lie kecu cila.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Lei. 94:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Aide ziemne, peu migede de minadung ziemne hegie so. Kedanemene ma pelane nnui gu delu, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Paul, mede Apollos, mede Cephas, mede kideube, mede kering, mede ketsai, mede cude, mede pecaide. Ma pelane nnui gu delu, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />nah nnui au Khrista gu, nah Khrista au Tinggwang gu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Khrista gu langkegaime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Mide peu anuide Khrista kilame lie nah Tinggwang macet kecokdung kekwame lie cetlu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ci rünne mene kekwamedung au kesamsang kecume maisia. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Dede a ziemne au nnui ne, mede mina tutiakki ne acu tiak zie lie kecu au ma keceu nage. Kedanemene Ih akatei acude tiak lama. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Kedanemene Ih au mage nede acu mmaula kemak ci, dede Ih aide ziemne masang lei kecube ma; dede acu tiak kelabe au Rampaube.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:12">Lei. 19:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Ciziemne peting cangkemak ne Rampaube cailikegwang dwa, magede tiak so. Pa kemui ga kebai teukeladung de kebaa gage kaizie nah mina lungningdung liagai zie. Iciude keheibede Tinggwang dade hetwa ngau luzie.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Cu ma aidungde sinamedung, nnui ziemne Ih Apollos anaide teu saukelia ge teigai da, ciu eh nnui anai dade aide cilu kerane:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 4:6">“Rauteu kela de gikah diso,”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 4:6">iciude migede ngang eh mige ziemne kedame de ngkau melu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Kedanemene caune ncu kedame swa teihu beuno? Nang ngaulu kemak daipai bam no? Nah nang cide ngaulu liecai, nang daitei ngaulu kemak nzwa ngang lano? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nnui au mnung dida! Nnui mahei dida! Anuide si mene nnui hegwang teibam dida, nah Ih peu nnuide hegwang tei kesang neu, iciu eh anuide nnuide ngngwa hegwang teilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Kedanemene Ih kecet au Tinggwang anui langkegaimedung de kamtube gage kaibeu, minadung de teitsetdi kera aja kaipwa kebamme nzwa. Kedanemene anui kideube dade miakpie ge teidi delu, tinggimgwame, nah minadung dade de. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Anui au Khrista ziemne kemieme ge, dede nnui au Khrista gade ma kecime ge. Anui au mnei, dede nnui au ngkieng. Nnuide au rütla, dede anuide au mneu. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Cu kecang de anui au mzeu nah hereu bam, nah anui au paiheni kemcui teuma, nah anuide dap kehei kenei tei, nah anui ki de gah eh la, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />anui nri süt eh anuikatei anui ba le heta tei. Anuide rangmsia kegaidau, anui samlam beula; anuide tei keherei kecudau, anui lia lula; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />anuide mi kii kecudau, anui zai yi eh samrangla. Anui au kideube ne gikedime dida nah cu kecangde ma pelane ngkau teila dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 3:45">Keh. 3:45</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Ih ma aidungde nnuide tei ngngam gai kerane raugai ma, dede nnuide kehung a namedung nzwa eh ledeu gaila. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Kedanemene Khrista gade nnuide kekwame cangkerei ge bam liede, nnui peime kekiee bam ma. Kedanemene Ih Khrista Jisu samliakeyi de gade nnui pei teidi delu. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Cine Ih acu kerelimedung tei lulo nnui dade kiela. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Aide ziemne, Ih nnui dage Timothy, akube nah Rampaube gade a na kesamsangbe de langgai la. Pecu peu Ih kehei ga ngqwaki leune ga ledeu kecude, Khrista Jisu gade Ih tei kegwang de nnui dage rang nsung dai beuzie. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Midungge Ih nnui da gwang kelak nzwa eh ngangla dida. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Dede Rampaube lungning lie cai, Ih nnui da kelwa gwang zie. Cidau Ih ngang kelame samdung rünne mene, penui kengkieng de peei mpet luzie. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Kedanemene Tinggwang hegwangram au sam kerang gade ma, dede kengkieng ga bam kecune. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nnui daipaude be neuno? Ih nnuida tsingria ge zie mi, mi keku nah rabe kenciep teu eh gwang lai?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Kemmha sinabe de gwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Nnui kakga kemmha bam lie kecu paubeu kesang zeu, nah cikenzwa kemmha ta au Gentileme kakgade bam lama; cide ci mige pe pei naude ngngwa kecude.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 18:8, 22:30</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Nah nnui au ngangla! Nnui nnui suisia kerabe meni? Nah heta kesia aide tei kegaibe de nnui kakgade gwadilu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Kedanemene Ih au pumteihbe gade bamme liede, Ih rabe gade nnuide ngngwa bam, nah Ih cika kebam nzwa eh heta cikenzwa tei kegaibe de kemmau sam ranggaila, <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi gade. Nnui ngkwa keludau, nah Ih nnuide rabe gade ngngwa kebam dau, anui Rampaube Jisu kengkieng teu <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />mina aipaude de peu pumteihbe ngkap dilu kerane Satan dage kaibeu dilu, iciu eh Rampaube cailikegwang tingba benai pe rabe de kelilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Nnui ngang kecude yi ma. Tsehi kecam nage ne tangku pelane tei punglu la kecu nnui ci meni? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Tsehi kehegwa de tei mcidi, iciude nnui tangku kehecibe teilu zie, nnui au tsehi kaikemak tangku kesang kecu nzwa. Kedanemene Khrista, anui Kahkegwang Ngyi meurünna de pwa ratak teidi delu. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Cine anui Kahkegwa Ngyi de, tsehi kehegwabe, mede kenlien zai nah kemau ketei tsehi le mene, kesangbe nah lungsang tsehi kai kemak tangku le hengyi lugo.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Ih pedwa a laisiu ga nnuide mina kemmhame de ngngwa kekangbau helo raugai da. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Ih cide kideu aika mina kemmhame, mede ma kehengimme, mede keregame, mede mamie kerecame de rang melie, iciu zie liecai nnui kideube gade tet mpetdi maisia. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Dede cu Ih nnui dage raukegai au, mige nnui sinabe gelie la, dede pa mmha, mede ma hengim, mede mamie reca, mede mide rangmsia, mede sakmie, mede migu sütketyei kecube de ngngwa kekangbau helo kecu lie. Cikenzwame de ngngwa matyei de so. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Kedanemene Ih ngqwa gwalebieme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngqwa gwalebieme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nlumkemakme</char></note> tutiaklwe daitei lai? Nnui ngqwame debe tiak kerabe meni? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Dede Tinggwang ne hegwale bie mede tiakla. Kesanglaisiu rangkela nzwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 5:13">“Nnui kakgade kesiabe de gwa mpet dilu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Hez. 13:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Kenlumme kakga hetuketiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Nnui mige ne mi keda gede ngngwa kesamlim kecudau, kemcimedung dwaga gwang mene masang kemakme dwa tutiakki ga gwang kera kekuu bam ni? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Mede kemcime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemcime </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 1:7</char></note> ne kideube tutiak kera nnui ci meni? Nah nnui ne kideube de tiak zie liecai, nnui makie keceuna gede tiak gailak ni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:22">Dan. 7:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Anui tinggimgwame de tiak zielie kecu nnui ci meni? Cine nnui aipau teilung ga kesamlim kecudung tiaklu bi kerabe. <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Cine, nnui aipau teilung de ga kesamlim kecudung bamcai, nnui daitei ngqwa ga malie la kemakme da hetutiak kera teugwang no? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ih aide nnuide teingngam gai kerane rang zeu. Nnui kakga migede maci eh nnui kenlumme kakga ngngwa kesamlim kecu tei mduilu kera gah deni? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Dede kenlumme ge kenlumme kedage de mmau eh nlumkemakme dwaga tutiakki ga gwang lani! <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Nnuikatei nnui kakgade ngngwa hetuketiak au nnui kau cangsiak kesang dida. Ciciu kecu swa maukedibe be yiki meni? Ciciu kecu swa cwakedibe be yiki meni? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Meliene nnui kemau tei nah mide cwala, nnui sinamedung de kecang de! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Mede nnui masang kemakme Tinggwang hegwangram gum gailak lie kecu ci meni? Nnuide peu cwa diso; kemmhame, mede mamie kerecame, mede kelak kahpet kemmhame, mede mipei heli li kelame, mede mipei mede mipui kerai ngngwa ma kesia keteime, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />mede keregame, mede migu kehenginme, mede sak kemieme, mede mide rang msia kelame, mede sütketyeime, Tinggwang hegwangram gum gailak. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Nah nnui midung ge ciciu la. Dede nnuide teimci luda, nnui mci luda, nnuide Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi gade nah anui Tinggwang Rabe gade tei masang luda.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemmha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />“Ma peciakne a ziemne petau,” dede peciakne au yikap ma. “Ma peciakne a ziemne petau,” dede Ih ma keheibe kangga lunghdi gailak. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Ketyeipok au miza ziemne, nah miza au ketyeipok ziemne, dede Tinggwang ma kena aide teingkap dizie. Mipum au kemmha ziemne ma, dede Rampaube ziemne, nah Rampaube au mipum ziemne. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nah Tinggwang Rampaube de kwakcuh luda, nah anuide de pe kengkieng le kwakcuh luzie. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Nnui pumdung Khrista dade kepet nnui ci meni? Ciciu cai Ih Khrista pum teugwang cidungde helipui pum teidi zieni? Ciciu daulak! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Mede mige helipui gede ncüt kedibe de au pumteih gade pecu ngngwa ket kedi nnui ci meni? Kedanemene aiciu rangla, “Hangna de teih ge tei dizie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:8">Mrk. 10:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Dede Rampaube de ncüt kelube pecu ngngwa rabe gade ket dida. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Kemmha gade mbailu! Mina kemau keda tei kela leune au mipum gwale ge teila, dede mmha kelabe au pekatei pe pum gage kemau tei gaila. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Nnui pum au nnui lung ga kebam, Tinggwang ne kepeu Kemci Rabe kerecaki lie kecu nnui ci meni? Nnui au nnuikatei nnui gu ma, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />kedanemene Tinggwang nnuide pemi tei eh lui luda. Ciziemne nnui pum gade Tinggwang de tei ndu lulo.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Laktak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Cu nnui laisiu ga raukegai hadungde: “Mipei ge mipui gede tung kemakbe yi.” <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Dede kemmha mdakkepie kehing de ziemne, mipei hangge ge kecu pekatei pe nau bamlu maisia, nah mipui hangge ge kecu pekatei pe nahpei bamlu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Peu penah de penau dage pe nsam tei gailu, nah cinzwa penau de penah dage pe nsam tei gailu. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Penau ge pekatei pe pum reu kengkieng gah, dede pe nahpei da bam. Nah cinzwa eh pe nahpei de pekatei pe pum reu kengkieng gah, dede penau da bam. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Hangge ge de mlai diso, tingkak ge ziemne kesamdau kelu gade gwale, iciu eh kekie gage nnui nnui ting kailu kerane. Pecai gwang ncüt dailu, iciude nnuikatei nnuide kezeulu kemak ziemne Satan nnuide kedei melu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ih aidungde aja ge nzwa rang ma, dede ainzwa lude petau zielie kecu gade rangla. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ih peu mina peciakne de Ih nzwa luneu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Langkegaibe Paul pe kelak teikemak teilung dede rang bam.</char></note> Dede hangge ge kecu Tinggwang dade pe mapeu riep bam,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang dade pe mapeu riep bam: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina keheibe de pekatei pe kemlang keyi riep bam </char></note> hangge mapeu aide, nah kedage mapeu lude. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Cu kelak teikemakme nah hemipuidung dage au, penui Ih nzwa bamlu zielie cai cide be yi zielie Ih rang gaila. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Dede penui penuikatei de kezeu gailak dicai, penui kelak teilu maisia. Kedanemene kehengin le pui kebam swa au kelak tei kelube yiki. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Cu kelak tei kelume dage Ih aja aide kaila—Ih ne ma, dede Rampaube ne—henau gede peu pe nahpei dade mpet ntsam kerabe ma <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />(dede pa mpet ntsamdi cai, peu pecu hemeu meu dai mene bamlu, mede peu pe nahpei de ngngwa kezuyi dailu), nah minahpei ge penau de tah kerabe ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Kedame pelane dage Ih rang gaila—Ih ne, Rampaube ne ma—nnui siname ge nlumkemak pui gede penau eh bamcai, nah pa pecu ngngwa lungh kera kesamdau lucai, pa cipau puide de tahdi kerabe ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Nah mipui ge nlumkemak pei gede penah teipwa bamcai, nah pa pecu ngngwa lungh kera kesamdau lucai, pa pe nahpei de tahdi kerabe ma. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Kedanemene nlumkemak nahpei de penau ziemne teimci lula, nah nlumkemak naude pe nahpei ziemne teimci lula. Iciu mecai nnui name au mci ma, dede cu au penui mci dida. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Dede nlumkemakbe de lamna di neucai, peu pecu tet dilu. Cikenzwa ga kenlum pei mede kenlum puide kang ma, kedanemene Tinggwang anuide lungciep gage qu gailu delu. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Kedanemene, mipuibo, nang dainzwa n nahpei de kelilu buimi mebi kecu cilu lai? Mede, mipeibo, nang dainzwa n nau de kelilu buimi mebi kecu cilu lai? <verse eid="1CO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Peu keheibede de Rampaube ne pecu teilo kebeu nzwa, nah Tinggwang ne pecu qugai kelu ga peu lunghlu. Ih ngqwaki leune ga ainzwa ledeula. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Mige pegeurum kelucai ne pecu qulu ni? Peu pecu hegeurum kelude teinggah diso. Mige pegeurum mene qulu ni? Pecu peu hegeurum so. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Hegeukerum de magede ma, nah hegeurum kemakde magede ma, dede Tinggwang sam kai kebeudung de mzai kerabe. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Keheibe de Tinggwang pecu qu keludau nzwa bamlu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ncu qu keludau nang hebaangme ge tei lani? Cide ziemne nang n lung pang so. Dede nang suirang ngaulu bui cai, ziuyi keyi cide luulu. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Kedanemene mige hebaangme ge teila eh Rampaube dage qugai kelube au Rampaube ne lungmpet kelume delu. Cinzwa eh, suirang teila eh qu kelube au Khrista baangme ge dida. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Nnuide Tinggwang ne pemi tei eh lui luda; cine mina baang tei diso. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Sinamedung, hangge ge kecu pecu qu keludau nzwa, peu pecu cinzwa Tinggwang de ngngwa bamlu.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Cu kelak tei kemakme ziemne au, Ih Rampaube dade sam kaikebeu magede ngau luma. Ciuliede, Rampaube dade ngaugia ngaukelu gade nlumlu kebuime ge nzwa a lungning ge Ih mzi gaila. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Cudau lungrei gwang kezeu de ziemne, a kecet au mige pekatei bam kelube yiki lie. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Nang n nau teilu deni? Pütti kera cet so. Nang n nau tei mereu ni? N nau tei kera cet so. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Dede nang n nau tei liede, nang kemau tei ma; nah releime ge meu de, pa kemau tei ma. Dede kelak tei kelume pumteih lungrei bam zie, nah Ih nnuide aide gade peu mbai luneu. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Dede Ih aide rangla, a sinamedung: Peting dui dida, cine cu gade penau kebammedung de peu penau kegahme nzwa lunghlu; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />nah hap kelame de peu hapla kemak nzwa; nah pe suiyi kelame de peu penui suiyila kemak nzwa; nah lui kelame de peu penui ma kegah nzwa; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />nah kideube gu teu lungh kelame de peu cide teu lungh kemak nzwa lunghlu. Kedanemene kideube zai reli aide au gahdi zielu. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Dede Ih nnuide peu lungrei gade relui luneu. Penau tei kemakbe dainzwa de Rampaube suiyi teilu zie bi de Rampaube tadung ziemne pelung kai lala. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Dede penau tei kelube dainzwa de penau suiyi teilu zie bi de kideube tadung ziemne pelung kai lala, nah pa pesui tsamdi la. Nah meu kemakbe pui mede relei kemcipui <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Rampaube tadung ziemne pelung kai lala, iciu eh pa pumteihbe gade nah rabe gade mcilu kerane. Dede meu kedibe pui, pa dainzwa de pe nahpei suiyi teilu zie bi de kideube tadung ziemne pelung kai lala. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ih aide nnui ziuyi ziemne rangla, nnui dage kekaam gede kaigai kerane ma, dede petautube teilu kerane nah magede kebwakdi mezing eh Rampaube ta teilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Dede mipei ge pe naurang teikelu releikemcipui de rütlu tadi kera ta teikera cetla dicai, nah pa meulu kera mmi kahdi eh meulu maisia dicai, mipeibe tei keneube tei kerabe da. Pa au kemau teima; peu penaide ngngwa lunghlu. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Dede mige ketang mene, pelung gade cetlwe pe hengin de kezeulu eh pelung gade relei kemcipui de ngngwa lungh laklie tiak lucai, mina aipaude petau da. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Cine, pe naurang teipwa kebam puide ngngwa lungh kelube pei au yi, dede pecu ngngwa lungh kemakbe pei au yiki. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Minau au pe nahpei lungh kebamtane pe kangga lunghla. Dede pe nahpei tsai dicai, pa keneube de pa ngngwa lungh lubui, dede Rampaube da kelame de rünne zie. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Dede a lungning au pa meu mene bam kecube pe suiyi ki zie. Nah Ih aide kerang de Tinggwang Rabe gade rangbam lie kecu Ih cetgai.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ketyeipuk mamie de ratak teibeu kedibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Cu ketyeipok pwa mamiedung de ratak tei kedibe ha nnui laisiu ga raukegai de: Anui pelane da maci kebam anui cibam. Maci mide teingang dila, dede keku au mide teimmi beula. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Keheibe de pa maci lie cet lacai, pa cimai kesiabe cilu mereu. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Dede mige Tinggwang de kula cai, cipaude de pa cila. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Cine, ketyeipok pwa mamiedung de ratak tei kedi ketyei ha de: Kideu aika mamie de au mage de kemak nah Tinggwang ket rünne kecu anui cibam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:39">Hez. 4:39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Kedanemene tinggim ga mede kideu ga tinggwangdung lie qukela bam de, “rabedung” nah “tinggwangdung” kekiee bam kecu nzwa, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />dede anui ziemne au Tinggwang ket cai gah, pa Peibe, peda de ma pelane gwang nah pe ziemne anui lunghla, nah RAMPAUBE Jisu Khrista de ket, pe dade ma pelane gwang, nah pe dade anui lunghla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:3">Jhn. 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 11:36">Rom. 11:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Iciuliede, maci aide peciakne da bam ma. Meliene, midungge au ndaa pe luige kedi nzwa cu kecangde ketyeipok aide mamiedung de ratak teibeu kedi nzwa tyei lala; nah penui kecet kemnei ne penuide teihera dila. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Dede ketyeipok ne anuide Tinggwang da ngngwa nna gwang gailak; anui tyei mede siaswa dilak, tyei liede yiswa gailak. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Dede nnui sünne lu, ciu eh nnui suira ketei aide ziemne kemneime puikaam ge teidi melu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Kedanemene nang ma kecibe mamie kerecaki ga matyei bam eh mige ncu ngau cai, pe lungcet kemnei de ziemne, mamie de ratak teibeu kedide tyei kera pecu teingkuu di lakni? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Cine kenlum kemneibe, n sinabe, Khrista pe ziemne tsaigai kebeube de n maci ziemne teingkap dizie. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Cine, nang n sinamedung dage kemau teigai nah penui lungcet kemneidung de tei rezamdi eh nang Khrista dage kemau teigai dizie. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Ciziemne, ketyeipok ne a sinabe puikaam teidi liecai, Ih madaude heteih tyei lakta, iciu eh Ih a sinabe puikaam teidi melu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Israel rasam gade rangmrak kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Ih suirang keteime ge meni? Ih langkegaime ge meni? Ih anui Rampaube Jisu de ngau meni? Nnui Rampaube gade a bata de meni? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ih kedame ziemne langkegaibe meliede, Ih nnui ziemne au langkegaibe lie. Kedanemene nnui au Rampaube gade Ih langkegaime ge lie kecu teimci lia kecu ge delu. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />A tu tiak kelame dade aide au a nzeuda: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Anui tyei nah sak kera anui nzeu bam meni? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Anui langkegaime kedamedung nzwa, nah Rampaube siname, nah Cephas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peter zi keda ge Cephas lie qula.</char></note> nzwa kenlum nau ge de ngngwa nzangla kera anui nzeu meni? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Mede Barnabas anai rünne mata tei eh anai pok hi tyei maisia ni? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Reugwame ge tei eh cau pekatei pe mabam mpet lano? Cau kubeluh ge talwe petsi tyeila meno? Mede cau meurün gui eh meurün hau tungdui sakla meno? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Ih aidungde mina kengkieng teu eh rangbam meni? Mede, hezaibe de ainzwa rangla meni? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Kedanemene Moses zai ga ainzwa raupwala, “Nnui ketumseu tsiu neumpet kebamdau pe mui cum diso.” Tinggwang hetumseu ziemne pelung nei lani?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Hez. 25:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Mede pa anui rünsangne ziemne rangbam meni? Cide anui ziemne rau pwala, kedanemene puh kelabe keregui bam eh puhla, nah neu kelabe de luhlüt pe qwa ngaulu kera regui eh neula. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Anui rabe leuh nnui kakgage gigai cai, anui nnui dade kideube taktyei rum kera petau medi zieni? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Mi kedame aipau nzeude nnui dade ngaulu lacai, anui au ngaulu kieeki kerabe meni? Dede anui aipau nzeude kie lama. Meliene peu magene de Khrista samlia keyi lampui kekaam tei melu kerane anui ma pelane de lia bamla. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Nnui kerecaki ga heta keteime kerecaki mabamdung gade tyei, nah recabam ga heta keteime racabam gudung gade nzi tyei kela nnui ci meni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:26">Lev. 6:26</ref>;<ref loc="LEV 18:1-3">18:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Cinzwa eh samliakeyi rang kelame samliakeyi de gade penui pok ngau tyei kerabe lie Rampaube sam kaibeu lie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat. 10:10</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk. 10:7</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim. 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Dede aipau nzeudung de Ih ket de kiema. Nah cidungde a ziemne teibeu lu kerane Ih aidungde raugai ma, kedanemene mide peu Ih hegie kelade tei nggahdi kera swa au Ih tsai kedibe a ziemne yiki. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Kedanemene Ih samliakeyi ledeu lade, Ih magede hegie kera kie gah, kedanemene tei maikesia aide acu nlum beudi delu. Ih samliakeyi teu rang ledeu mecai peu a da suisiet gwang lulo! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Kedanemene Ih aide neu ngga eh teicai, a ziehi ge bam. Dede neu meliede, pie rengei kera acu nlumbeu dida. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Iciucai a ziehi dai no? Cide au Ih samliakeyi rang ledeu kecudau, Ih samliakeyi de pemi tei mene mide pwapeu lu kera deda, iciu eh samliakeyi de ga a nzeu pelane teumelu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Kedanemene Ih au pelane gade suirang keteime ge liede, Ih akatei acu teipwa mina pelane kila tei dida, iciu eh Ih Khrista ziemne mina kekiee ge ngaulu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Jewme dade Ih Jewme ge nzwala, iciu eh Jewme de qulu kerane. Hezaibe kangga kelame dade, Ih de hezaibe kangga kelame ge nzwa dila, Ih hezaibe kangga la meliede, iciu eh hezaibe kangga kelame de qulu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Hezaibe kangga la kemakme dade Ih hezaibe kangga la kemakme ge nzwa la (Ih Tinggwang hezaibe kangga la melie kecube ma, Khrista zaibe kangga la) iciu eh Ih hezaibe kangga la kemakme de qulu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Kemneime dade Ih mnei lula, iciu eh Ih kemneime de qulu kerane. Ih mina pelane ziemne ma pelane tei dida iciu eh Ih ma keheibe gade de mina kangge de kelilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Ih ma pelane samliakeyi de ziemne teila, iciu eh Ih de cipau samlam ga ncütlu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Hezukemzu ga kepakme pelane pakla, dede hangge rünne ziehi ngaulu kela nnui ci meni? Cine nnui cide ngaulu kerane pak lulo. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Kenggwame keheibe de ma pelane gade pekatei pecu kezeu la. Penui cide peurwa rimdi kera ge ngaulu kerane teila, dede anui au rimdi kelakge ziemne teila. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Ciziemne Ih pekie kegah nzwa pak lama; Ih tingkai de zum kela nzwa eh regi lama. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Dede Ih a pum tei taklwe cide kezeu teula, iciu eh Ih mide ledeu kelucai, acube gikedi teidi melu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Ih nnuide peu ci mene bamneu ma, sinamedung, anui peime pelane de hemwa ne gumteu gwang nah pelane de Jaaidi Kegie de kahgwang lie kecude,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:29">Tet. 14:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />nah hemwa gade nah jaaidi gade penui pelane de Moses caisuime tei eh duipum tei kaplu, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />nah penui pelane de rabe taktyei de tyei,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Tet. 16:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Hez. 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />nah penui pelane de rabe kesakbe duide sak, kedanemene penui tsura rabe penui caisui kelade gade sak, nah tsura cide au Khrista.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Tet. 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 20:11">Hez. 20:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Dede Tinggwang mi kekiee ge de pesui tadi nah penui paaudung hetaideu gage teizang gaidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:17">Heb. 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Cu aidungde anui ziemne saukelia ge da, iciu eh anui ma kesiabedung, penuide hengin kela nzwa hengin melu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Penui mina kangge nzwa mamie kerecame tei diso; kesanglaisiu ga raupwakela nzwa, “Minadung matyei masak kera ntum bamlu, delwe helim lim kera cuhdi.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Penui kekiee ge nzwa anui kemmha ta tei buima, penui cikenzwa tei eh tingnaige gage mina cang ngkai eh kecum tsaidi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Pum. 25:1</ref>;<ref loc="NUM 25:9">25:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Penui kekiee ge nzwa anui Khrista de kedak kerabe ma, penui pecu kedak pie eh penuide heneidung ne tei ngkapdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5-6">Pum. 21:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Penui kekiee ge nzwa anui ncam kerabe ma, penui ncam gai eh penuide kengkappe ne ngkapdi. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Cu ma aidungde penuida teikegai de au saulia kegai ge. Cidungde au anuide rang mriaklu kerane raupwa bam, kedanemene anui peting penlibe ga lungh kebam ziemne. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ciziemne mige pa saplu delie cet kelabe de peu sünne lu, ciu eh pa kaudi melu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Mdakkepie gede nnuida gwang mereu, mina da gwangla kela de gwale. Dede, Tinggwang au samsang, pa nnui liagai kelak nreu pwa nnuide kedei lak, dede mdakkepie de si eh pa mbai lukera lampui de peuzie, iciu eh nnui cide lialu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:9">2 Pet. 2:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamie kerecadung nah Rampaube kensung taktyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Cine, akumedung, mamie kereca gade mbai lulo. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Ih kemriakme dage nzwa eh rangla; Ih kerang de nnuikatei tiak lulo. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Anui samlam kebeu piak pwa samlam kelade, Khrista jai ga bamde meni? Anui tangku teipang kelade, Khrista pumbe ga ngngwa ncüt bamde meni? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Tangkukwak ket rünne kecune, anui kekiee ge liede ngngwa pum ge, kedanemene anui pelane de tangkukwak ket de gade ngngwa tyei kelane. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Israelme ha cetgai pielo. Ratak teibeu kedibe pwa ketyeime recabam ga heta keteime de ngngwa kemacüt bamde meni? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Ciucai Ih dai rangzeu no? Ketyeipok mamie de pwa ratak tei kedibe au pe kemlang bamlie rangla ni, mede mamiedung au kesanglie rang lani? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ma, Ih rang kelade kiecai, Gentileme ratak tei kelade penui herakesiadung de ratak tei beula nah Tinggwang de ma. Dede Ih nnuide peu herakesiabe de ngngwa kemacüt kecume teineu ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Hez. 32:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Nnui Rampaube piak nah herakesiabedung piak gade ngngwa sak gailak. Nnui Rampaube taktyeibam nah herakesiabedung taktyeibam gade ngngwa tyei gailak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat. 6:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Mi anui Rampaube rata teigai neu lano? Anui pe swa ngkiengki ni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Hez. 32:21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat. 6:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenlumme suirang ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Ma pelane tei lubui,” dede ma pelane pe kemmi gah. “Ma pelane tei lubui,” dede ma pelane mide tei mmi lu lama. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Peu migede de pekatei pe ziuyibe peei so, dede mi kedame ziuyibe peei lu. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Nnui lungcet gade magede keteu mene, litakni ga zwa kebambe pelane tyei lubui. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Kedanemene, “Kideube nah cika kebam keheibe de Rampaube gulu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Lei. 24:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Nlum kemakme keheibede nnuide matyei kera qucai, nah nnui mie neucai, nnui lungcet gade magede keteu mene nnui dwa gage kai kebeube pelane tyei lulo. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Dede mige nnui dade, “Aide pwa ratak teibeu dida,” de eh rang cai, cide tyei so, nnui dage rang kebeube de ziemne nah lungcet de ziemne, <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />cu Ih n lungcet de rangbam ma, dede pe lungcet de rangbam. Kedanemene daitei kedabe lungcet le a suirang ketei tiak lai? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ih Tinggwang de twagai eh ngngwa matyei cai, daitei Ih twa kegai de ziemne acu kii lano? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Ciziemne, nnui tyei mede sak liede, mede nnui ma keheibe tei liede, pelane Tinggwang kendu ziemne tei lulo. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Jewme mede Greekme, mede Tinggwang ngqwabe suisiet teiso. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Ih de ma pelane gade mina leune suiyi tei kera teila. Ih akatei a ziuyi peei lama, dede mi kekiee ziuyi peeila, iciu eh penuide kelilu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Ih Khrista ciem reli kelu nzwa, a ciem reli lulo.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kereca ga petaube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Cu Ih nnuide twala, kedanemene nnui ma pelane gade de acu nsung bam kelane, nah Ih nnuide ledeu kebeu hezaidungde nnui nzui kelane. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Cu Ih nnuide peu mina leune peube au Khrista, nah mipui peube au mipei, nah Khrista peube au Tinggwang lie kecu cilu neu. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Mipei keheibe de pe peu hezui lwe kekie tei mede caihakecisam rang kelabe, pe peu keu hengam tei dila. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Dede mipui keheibe de pe peu hezui mene kekie tei mede caihakecisam rang kelabe au pe peu keu hengam tei dila. Kedanemene cide au pe peu taikedi nzwakap delu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa pe nahpei de hengam tei dida. Paul tingdau mipui peu tai kecu au pekie hengam ta teidi kecu ziemne. </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Kedanemene mipui ge pe peu hezui meliecai, peu pe peutam de rumdi lu. Dede pe peutam rum kedi mede pe peu tai kedi mipui ziemne hengam ge cai, peu pecu pe peu hezuilu. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Mipei ge au Tinggwang rehibe nah kendube lu, pe peu hezui kerabe ma. Dede mipui au mipei kendube. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Kedanemene mipei de au mipui dade teilu ma, dede mipui de au mipei dade teilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21-23">Ken. 2:21-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Mede mipei de mipui ziemne damgai ma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mipei de mipui ziemne damgai ma: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mipui de au mipei relui nah suiyi ziemne teigai. Hebaang tei kerane ma</char></note> dede mipui de mipei ziemne damgai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18">Ken. 2:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Cine tinggimgwame ziemne, mipui au penah kengkieng kangga lalie kecu keulia lu kerane pe peu hezui maisia. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Iciuliede, Rampaube gade mipui au mipei de teu mede yi, nah mipei de mipui de teu mede yilie kecube ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Kedanemene mipui de au mipei dade teikelu nzwa eh mipei de mipui dade lunghgwang lu: dede ma pelane Tinggwang dade gwang. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Nnuikatei de cet pielo: Mipui ge pe peu hezui mene Tinggwang dade kekie tei kecu petau ni? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Mina zai gade de mipei ge pe tam mzwak pungtie lacai, cide au pe ziemne hengam ge lie kecu nnuide ledeu beu meni? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Dede mipui ge pe tam pungtie lacai, cide au pe pwa de meni? Kedanemene pe tam ketie de au pe peu halu kerane pecu pwapeu delu. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Dede keheibe de aipau hade rang repia neucai, anui mede Tinggwang ngqwadung de hezai keda gede gah.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube kensung taktyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Dede ledeu kegai aipau samdung de gade Ih nnuide twa lama, kedanemene nnui gwang ngkwakelu au yiki lu kera ziemne ma, dede siakidi kera ziemne lu. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Kedanemene, keraibe, nnui ngqwaki ga gwang ngkwa keludau, nnui kakga hemaabe nzidi lie kecu Ih siu, nah Ih cide ma kesa nlum kesang. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Nah nnui kakga hemaa ketsamtsam bam kesang maisia da, iciu eh nnui kakga Tinggwang pesui kelume de peu ci ncigilu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Cine, nnui bam ge ga gwang ngkwa kelu au Rampaube Kensung taktyei tyei kera ziemne ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Kedanemene matyei kera ting dige, hangge ge kecu pe taktyei riep tyei raila; cine mige nzeu bamla, nah kedabe sakmie dila. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Nnui tyei nah sak kera kidung gahni? Mi nnui Tinggwang ngqwa de mlai nah ma kegahme de hengam tei lano? Ih nnui dage dai rang lai no? Ih nnuide aide ziemne twa zie ni? Ih nnuide twa daulak! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Kedanemene Ih Rampaube dade ngaukelude Ih nnui dage de ranglia di delu, cide Rampaube Jisu pecu tuigai kedibe ziu, tangku keulu, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />nah pa hetwa peugai eh cide tei poplwe rangdi, “Aide nnui ziemne a pum da. Acu kensung gade aide teilu.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Cinzwa eh, matyei kelucai pa hepiak de pwalwe, ranggai, “Aipau piak de au a jai gade samkakkelu kehecibe da. Aide nnui kesak dau, acu kensung gade teilu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:20">Luk. 22:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Kedanemene nnui tangku aide tyei nah hepiak aide kesak ramsangne, nnui pa gwang kemaktane Rampaube tsit ha ranglia bam lugu. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Ciziemne, keheibe de, pezai petau mene tangku de tyei mede Rampaube piak de sak cai, Rampaube pum nah pe jai de mmau eh kemau tei dizie. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Dede peu migede pekatei pecu keteu siaktelu eh peu pecu tangkube tyei nah hepiakbe saklu. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Kedanemene Rampaube pum hade ci siakte mene tyei nah sak kelabe, pekatei pemau tyei nah sakgai lula. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ciziemne nnui kakga mina kekieege mnei nah mateei bam, nah nnui mina kekieege tsai dida. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Dede anuikatei anuide keteusiakte lucai, anuide mmau dilak. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Dede anuide Rampaube ne tiak kecudau, anuide ledeu lula, iciu eh anuide kideube de ngngwa mmaudi melu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Ciziemne, a sinamedung, nnui Kensung Taktyei tyei kera ngkwa keludau, hangge ge de kerekwa lu. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Mige mzeu lacai, peu pecu kilung gade matyeilu, iciu eh nnui tutiak ga gwang ncüt melu kerane. Nah nnui rau kegai kedabedung ziemne au, Ih gwanglude Ih nnui puisaudung peu beuzie.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Rabe mapeudung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Cu sinamedung, nnui laisiu gage raukegai rabe mapeudung ha de, Ih nnuide peu ci mene bam neuma. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Nnui Khrista de nlum kemakdau, nnuide teukegai leuga, nnui mamie pekwa kegahdung de lambie rwala kecu nnui cibam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:8">Gal. 4:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Ciziemne migede Tinggwang rabe gade rang kelame “Jisu au reset pung,” de eh rang kelak nah migede “Jisu au Rampaube,” de Kemci Rabe gade mai ranggai kelak Ih nnuide peu ci mci gaila.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Cu mapeudung ketsamtsam bam, dede Rabe au ket. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Nah zierang ta ketsamtsam bam, dede Rampaube au ket. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Nah heta ketsamtsam bam, dede mileune da ma pelane heta tei kebambe au Tinggwang lie. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Hangge gede ngha eh pelane mmilu kera Rabe mapeu anui pelane dage pwapeu. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Rabe ne migede kemteusam kerang pwapeu, nah cipau Rabe dene kedage de macisam kerangde cilu kera pwapeu, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />cipau Rabe dene kedage de kenlum peu, nah cipau Rabe dene kedage de teikengkei mapeu peu, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />nah kedage de kengkieng bata teilu kera, kedage de caihakecisam kerang, kedage de rabedung ci ntsamlu kera, kedage de helet ketsamtsam ranglu kera, nah kedage de helet ketsamtsam ranglia mcilu kera peu. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Dede ma aidung pelane Rabe ket ne teigai, pa pesui gade hangge gede cidungde nzi beula.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pum ge, zi kekiee ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Mipum au ket nah penzi kekiee ge bamla, dede mipum nzi pelane, kekiee ge liede, pum ge kecu nzwa; Khrista de cide nzwa da. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Kedanemene Rabe ket gade anui pelane de duipum teipwa pum ge tei luda, Jewme mede Greekme, hebaang keteime mede tei kemakme, nah pelane de Rabe ket gade sak kera peu. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Kedanemene pumbe au zi ge ma, dede kekiee ge. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Hepi, “Ih au heba ge melu, Ih au pum ga ncüt ma,” de eh rang liede, cide ziemne pum ga ncüt ta swa gailak. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Nah mikwen, “Ih miak melu, Ih pum ga ncüt ma,” de rang liede, cide ziemne pum ga ncüt ta swa gailak. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Mipum pelane mimiak dicai, dai gade siu lai? Mipum pelane mikwen dicai, dai gade nghuilu lai? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Dede cu Tinggwang mipum nzidung ket ket kecude pa pesuibe nzwa eh mipum gage kaibeu pwabam. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Dede cidungde pelane nzi ket liecai, mipumbe daiga bam lai? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Cine cu nzidung kekiee ge bam, dede mipum au ket. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Mimiak miba dade, “Ih ncu teu maisia ma,” de eh ranggai lak. Mede pecaide, mipeube mipi dade, “Ih ncu teu maisia ma,” de eh ranggai lak. <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ciciu kecube meliene, mipum nzidung mneiki kecube de teu maisia ki, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />nah anui mipum nzidung herüt cam lie cet kelabe, anui cidungde de herüt peu kila, nah mipum nzi ngau hezu yi kemakpe mapie sünne la, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />dede anui nzidung hezu keyibe cidungde teu maisia ma. Dede Tinggwang mipum de keu ncüt siakte gai, herüt peu kemakpe de herüt peu ki eh, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />iciu eh mipum kakga peu nzi pang melu kerane, dede mipum nzidung helungnei nsam eh ket ket de kema pielu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Cine mipum nzi ket keherei dige, nzidung pelane ngngwa keherei dila; nah mipum nzi ket hetwa pung luge, nzidung pelane ngngwa mi suiyi lula. <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Cu au nnui Khrista pumbe dida nah cide ga zi ge dida. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Nah Tinggwang ngqwaki ga kangge de kedet pwa bam kesang, keraibe langkegaime, kenabe caihakecime, kecumbe keledeume, pecai miswakegah bata keteime, pecai mateei teikengkei mapeu, kenghame, piekerengeime, nah helet ketsamtsam kerangme. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Peciakne langkegaimedung ni? Peciakne caihakecimedung ni? Peciakne keledeumedung ni? Peciakne miswakegah bata tei lani? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Peciakne mateei teingkei lu kebui mapeu bam ni? Peciakne helet ketsamtsam rang lani? Peciakne pekie ranglia lula ni? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Dede mapeu kedibedung hengin lulo. Nah cu Ih nnuide yigwa kecu ge keulia zie.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Keku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ih mina let gade nah tinggimgwame let gade maranglu liede, Ih keku gah cai, Ih au hegeu kehedeu kwa ge mede hebam kedap kwa ge dida. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Nah Ih caihakecisam kerang mapeu bam liede, nah macetkecok leune nah maci leune ci liede, nah Ih lamlwadung teu nlai lu kera kenlum leune bam liede, iciu de ada keku gah cai, Ih au magede ma. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nah Ih a mabam pelane peudi liede, nah Ih a pum peudi eh ngang lubui bam liede, iciu de ada keku gah cai, Ih magede kemmi gah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa yitube laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">Ih a pum peudi iciu eh nganglu kerane, de eh peila. </char>Keda laisiudung ga, <char style="fqa">Ih a pum ru kerane peu </char> de peila. </note> <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Keku au pelungtie nah mide ngau ngaunggia la; keku mide periak lama; keku helia mede ngang lama. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Keku au pezai sia lama, mede pekatei peziu ci lama, perata zette di lama, mede mi kesia teigai de cide pelung gage kaiteu lama. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Keku au masang kemakbe pesui lama, dede kesangbe ga pesui lala. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Keku ma pelane gum lula, ma pelane nlum la, ma pelane ga keregui bamla, ma pelane lia lula. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Keku au penli bam lama. Caihakecisamdung bam liede, cidungde gah dizie: helet ketsamdung bamde, cidungde mtak dizie; maci bamde, cide gah dizie. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Kedanemene anui maci au cang ma nah anui caihakeci kerang de au cang ma. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Dede yicangsiak kecube kegwang dau, cang kemakpe au gah dizie. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ih hena dau, hename ge nzwa marang, hename ge nzwa macet, hename ge nzwa ma mning. Ih ngkiengcuh luge, Ih hename zaidungde gi dida. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Kedanemene cu anui kengau de au miakpiebung gade ngau mci kemak nzwa, dede pecai kezumok eh ngau dizie. Cu Ih ma cicang ma, dede pecai Ih ci cangsiak luzie, Tinggwang acu ci cangsiak kela nzwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Dede cu makecum aidungde bam: kenlum, keregui nah keku. Dede aidungde kakde ditube au keku.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Caihakecisam nah helet mapeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Keku de gwa zuilu nah rabe mapeudung henginlu, keraide nnui caihakecisam ranglu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Kedanemene helet ketsam gade marang kelabe mina dage marang bam ma, dede Tinggwang dage rangbam lu; migede pe sam ci lama, dede pa rabe gade macikecok sam rangla. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Dede caihakecisam rang kelabe, minadung dage rangla, penuide teimmi lu, nah teingkuu lu, nah teinciep lu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Helet ketsam gade rang kelabe pekatei pecu tei mmi lula, dede caihakecisam kerangbe ngqwabe de teimmi lula. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Cu Ih nnui pelane de peu helet ketsam rang neu, dede nnuide peu caihakecisambe rang neu kireu. Cu caihakecisam kerangbe au helet keda gade kerangbe swa diki reu (pa pekie rang mci lialu zielie mai, iciu eh ngqwabe de teimmi lu kera). <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Dede cu au, sinamedung, Ih nnui da helet ketsam gade marang eh gwang liecai, Ih daipai kemmi nnuide peu zieno? Ih nnui dage Tinggwang ne keuliakegai sam gade, mede maci gade, mede caihakecisam gade, mede keledeu gade rang meliecai. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Pe keringria kegah pe kwa tei kela maniadung kecangde—terwaine mede leibung de—pe kwa ketsamtsam teilu meliecai, terwaine gade kwa kebamde mede leibung gade kwa kebamde dainzwa ci lulai? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Kedanemene teluibe kwa mci gaibeu mecai, cau hereu teikera mtei lai? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Cine nnuide cide nzwa da, nnui helet keda gade kerang de rangmci gaimai, dai rangzeu bi kecu dainzwa ci lulai? Iciucai nnui tingkai gage ranggai kebam da. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Kideu ga heletdung ketsamtsam kekiee ge bam kesang, nah kette pekie kegah teima. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Dede Ih helet rang kebam kiede ci mecai, Ih marang kebambe dade sangme ge dizie, nah marang kebambe a dade sangme ge dizie. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Nnuide cinzwa da, nnui rabe mapeudung luuneu kebam nzwa, nnui ngqwabe de tei hemilu kerabe peei lulo. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Cine helet kedage gade kerangbe de pa rangmci lialu kerane kielu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ih helet kedage gade kiege, a rabe de kie bamla, dede a kecet au cika ngngwa ncüt lama. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Ciziemne, Ih daitei maisia no? Ih a rabe de ngngwa kie zie, nah Ih a kecet dede ngngwa kie zie. Ih a rabe de ngngwa lei teizie, nah a kecet dede ngngwa lei teizie. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Iciu meliecai, nang Tinggwang de rabe gade twabam de, dainzwa eh maidakme bam teipui kebamme, nang twa kebam kekie de gage, “Amen” de eh ranglu laino? Kedanemene pa nang rang kebam kiede ci melu. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Kedanemene nang hetwa peu hemisüt gai bam lubui, dede kedame ziemne au kemmi gah. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Ih nnui pelane swade helet ketsam gade marang kieeki kecune Ih Tinggwang de twala; <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />dede Ih ngqwaki gade helet ketsam gade sam cangkerei rang kecu swa au a lung gade sam kie mengei be rang neu, iciu eh Ih mi kedame de ledeu lu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Sinamedung, nnui macet ga hename nzwa diso. Meliene kesiabe gade hename nzwa lu, dede nnui lungcet gade au kengkiengme teilu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Hezaibe ga ainzwa raupwala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">“Mi kedame let gade nah sangme muileu gade</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Ih mina aidungde dage marang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">iciude penui a sam kingnei lak,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Isa. 28:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:21">de Rampaube rangla. <verse eid="1CO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Cine, helet keda gade kerang au marehi kenlumme ziemne ma, dede nlum kemakme ziemne; dede caihakecisam au nlum kemakme ziemne ma, dede kenlumme ziemne. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Ciziemne, ngqwame pelane heni gega gwang ngkwa delwe penui pelane helet keda gade marang bam eh maidakme mede nlum kemakmedung lütcai, penui nnuide kemieme lie ranglak ni? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Dede nnui pelane caihakecisam rang cai, nah nlum kemakme kangge mede maidakme ge lüt cai, pa cide pelane kesang lie ci lula nah pa siu kelu leune ne pecu tiakla, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />pe lungning kengkimdung keumpet lia gaila, nah ciciu eh pa pe zu keumie eh Tinggwang de reca zie, “Tinggwang nnui kakga bam kesang lie,” de rang eh.<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsimrim eh kereca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />A sinamedung, ciciu cai dainzwa lai? Nnui reca kera gwang ngkwa keludau, mige lei tei, kedage ledeu, kedage Tinggwang keuliakegai sam rang, kedage helet ketsam gade marang, mede kedage pekie rang mcilia kecu bamla. Peu ma pelane ngqwabe de teimmi lu kera ziemne tei lulo. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Mige helet keda gade marang cai, cide hangna mede kieetu gade hangcum ge lu maisia, nah ket cai ket penlia tei eh ranglu, delwe peu hangge de pekie ranglia beulu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Dede migede pekie ranglia kera gah cai, peu pecu ngqwaki gade mlei mene bamlu, nah peu pekatei pecu nah Tinggwang de mpaulu. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Peu caihakecime hangna mede hangcum de ranglu, nah peu kedame de petaumi mebi cetlu. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Dede cika kebam kedabe de keuliakegai ge ngau cai, peu keraibe de mtak dilu. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Kedanemene nnui hangge cai hangge eh pelane caihakecisam rang lubui, iciu eh pelane cilu nah pelane de teingkuu lu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Caihakecisam kerangme rabedung au penui kangga bam. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Kedanemene Tinggwang au ma kehebwak Tinggwang ma, dede lungciep Tinggwang. Kemcime ngqwadung pelane ga nzwa, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />peu mipuidung de ngqwaki ga matu mene bamlu. Kedanemene penuide marang kera peu ma, dede hezaibe ga rang kebeu nzwa samzai teilu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Cinzwa liede penui ma keheibe de cineu cai, peu penuide kilung gade penui nahpeidung dade keteulu, kedanemene mipui ngqwaki gade marang kecu hengam gelu. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Mi Tinggwang sam nnui dade petlu dino? Mi cide nnui da rünne gwang no?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Mige pekatei pecu le caihakecime gelie mede rabe kilam kelame gelie lacai, peu pecu Ih nnui dage raukegaide au Rampaube aja lie kecu cet lulo. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Dede keheibe de aide le pwane malie lamai, peu pecu de malie so.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiudung yitube ga, </char><char style="fqa">Dede magade keheibe de aidele pwane malie lamai, peu pecu de malie so </char> de eh bam. Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga <char style="fqa">Dede magade keheibe de aide cilu mai, peu pecu ciso </char> de eh bam </note><verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Cine, sinamedung, caihakecisam rang kerade hengin süt lulo, nah helet keda gade kerang de kaam so. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Dede peu ma pelane petau tei eh nah penlia tei siakte eh tei lulo.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Khrista ringcuh kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Ih nnui dage samliakeyi zierang tei kegaide, cu Ih nnuide peu cigai daila, sinamedung, cide nnui luulu da, nah nnui cide ga sap bam, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Ih nnui dage zierang tei kegai samde nnui herak ntip bam lucai, cide ne nnuide kelilu zie, nnui kenlum kemta gedi maige. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Kedanemene Ih de ngaukelu mlangtube Ih nnuide peu dida, cide kesanglaisiu ga raupwa kela nzwa, Khrista anui mau ziemne tsai kebeude, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />nah pecu kung kedi nah iciu eh kesanglaisiu ga nzwa pa langcumne benai ring cuh dai kelude,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:2">Hos. 6:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />nah pa Cephas <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cephas: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Langkegaibe Peter.</char></note> nah pecai kereiekena bau de pecu peu ngau kegaide. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Pecai pa piage gage pe caisuime haimengei swade kekiee de peu pecu ngaugai, penui kekiee ge ringbam reu, dede kangge au tsai dida. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Pecai pa James nah langkegaime pelane de peu pecu ngaugai. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Kamtube, Ih peting kemakne mnakelu nzwa liede acu peu pecu ngaugai. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Kedanemene Ih au langkegaimedung kakgade ceutu nabe, acu langkegaime liede qu daulak, kedanemene Ih Tinggwang ngqwa de teikeherei gwanglu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Dede Ih cu ainzwa kebam de au Tinggwang ngaugia gade, nah pe ngaugia ada kebam de au kemta teidi ma. Meliene, Ih penui pelane swa matei heri ki, ciude cide Ih ne ma, dede Tinggwang ngaugia ada kela dene. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Cine cide Ih ne mede penui ne liede ainzwa eh ledeula, nah nnui nlum luda.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ketsaime ringcuh kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Cu Khrista ketsai gade ringcuh kelude zierang teila cai, dainzwa nnui kakga kangge ketsaime ringcuhdai kelu gahlie ranglu laino? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Dede ketsaime ringcuhdai kecu gah cai, Khrista de de kwak cuhlu meda; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />nah Khrista de ketsai gade kwakcuh lu meliecai, anui zierang tei kelade de kemta dida, nah nnui kenlum de de kemta dida. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Cipau reude, anui Tinggwang zierang kenret teila dida, kedanemene Tinggwang Khrista de ketsai gade kwakcuh dailu delie anui zierang tei kelane, ketsaime ringcuh dai me kesang liecai, pa pecu kwakcuh luma. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Kedanemene ketsaime de kwak cuhlu mecai, Khrista de de kwakcuh luma; <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />nah Khrista de kwak cuhlu mecai, nnui kenlum au kemta; nnui cude nnui mau ga lareu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Iciu cai Khrista de nlum eh tsai kedimedung de kap dida. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Anui aipau teilung de rünne ziemne Khrista de regui bam liecai, anui au minadung pelane kakde nggiatume delie.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Dede cu Khrista de ketsai gade kwakcuh luda, tsai kedime kakde petsi raitube. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Mipei ge dade ketsai gwang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mipei ge dade ketsai gwang: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adam dade, mede pa hezai gikah kedi gade.</char></note> kelu nzwa, mipei ge dade ketsai gade ringcuhdai kecude gwanglu. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Adam gade pelane tsai kedi nzwa eh Khrista gade pelane de tei nring luzie. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Dede hangge ge de penlia gade zie: Khrista petsi raitube, pecai pa cailikegwang dau, Khrista gu tei kelamedung zie. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Pecai Khrista kedime pelane, kengkieng keteu nah kengkieng pelane ngkapdi de nah pa hegwangram Peibe Tinggwang de peudi de kideu penli dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan. 2:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Khrista pe ngauraume pelane de pe pi kangga ge kaidi kemaktane pa ne dibam maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Lei. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Ngaurau kamtube ngkapdi kerabe au ketsai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:14">Heb. 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Kedanemene Kesanglaisiu rangla “Tinggwang ma pelane pe pi kang gage kai dida.” Dede, “Pa ma pelane pwa pe kekang gage kai dida,” de kerang dau, pa pe kang gage kai kedibe de cika si kemak mcigi da.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Lei. 8:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Pecai, ma pelane de pe kangga ge kaikelu cai, Nabe de ma pelane pwa pe kangga ge kai kebeube de kangga ge pekatei pecu kai dizie, iciu eh Tinggwang ne ma pelane reu ditube teilu kerane.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Mecai, ketsaime ziemne duipum tei kelume daipai teilai? Ketsaime ringcuh dai me kesang liecai, daitei penui ketsaime ziemne duipum tei lano? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Daitei anuide bamdapkak msangne kengngi kerehim ga la laino? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Sinamedung, Ih tingba ramsangne ketsai dau bam! Ih anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade nnui ziemne hegie kelade ziemne Ih aide sampet gaila. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Mina kecet ria gade, Ih Ephesus namdi gade renaam kaunedung de ngngwa regicai, Ih daipai kemmi bamno? Ketsaime cuhdaila meliecai, “Anui tyei nah sak bam go, kedanemene ncünne anui tsai zielu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa. 22:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nnuide cwa diso: “Mi kangngwa kesia gade mizai keyi de teimsia dila.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Nnui lung petau ga caili gwanglu! Nah kemau tei sita dilu. Kedanemene nnui midung ge Tinggwang ha cima, Ih aide nnui ngngam rang gaila.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ringcuhkelu pum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Dede midung ge rangzie, “Dainzwa eh ketsaime cuhdai lai, nah penui pum dainzwa eh penui gwang zie no?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Nang kemiebo! Nang ling kegaide tsaigai mai ringcuh dai lama. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Nah nang ling kegaide au, pe bang lungh cuh kerade ma, dede petsira ge, wheat mede ma kedage lubui. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Dede Tinggwang ne pe suibe nzwa cide pe pum ge peuzie, nah petsiradung ketket de, pepum rip peuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:11">Ken. 1:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ring kela kaune leune teih nzwakap ma. Meliene, mina pumteih tsam, nah makaune pumteih tsam, nah nruine pumteih tsam, nah heka de tsam. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Tinggim pumdung nah kideu pumdung de bam. Dede Tinggim kendu au kideube kendu dade tsam. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Tingnaimiak kendu au tsam, nah hekei kendu de tsam nah hegidung kendu de tsam. Kedanemene hegi ge hegi kedage dade pe kendu tsam kecune. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Cine ketsaime ringcuh kecu cide nzwa da. Riemdi kera gage ling kegaide, tsaidai kelak gage ringcuh dai lula. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Cide hengam tei eh linggai; dede ndu eh cuhlu. Cide mnei eh linggai; dede ngkieng eh cuhlu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Cide pumteih ge eh linggai; dede rabe pumteih ge eh cuhlu. Pumteihbe pum ge bamcai, rabe pumteih de bam zie. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Cine ainzwa raupwa la, “Adam mina raitube ringkela keringria ge teidi.” Adam kekambe kering kepeu rabe ge teidi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Dede rabe rai ma dede pumteihbe, nah pecaine rabe. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Kideube gade mina raitube Adam de tangdei le teilu. Dede Khrista, mina pekenabe au Tinggim gade gwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:31">Jhn. 3:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Kideube gu tei kelame au tangdei le teikelube nzwa da; nah tinggim gu tei kelame au tinggim gade kegwangbe nzwa da. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Nah anui cu tangdei le teikelu mina rehi kecu nzwa, anuide Tinggim gade kegwangbe rehi de nzwa dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:2">1 Jhn. 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Cu Ih aide rangla, sinamedung, miteih nah mijai dene Tinggwang hegwangram gum gailak. Mede rimdi kerabe rimdi kelakpe de gum gailak. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ainie! Ih nnui dage macetkecok ge ranggai la: anui pelane zip dilak, dede anui pelane tsam dizie, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />kaknage gage, miakhip kegai gage, telui kamtube kwa kegai gage. Kedanemene telui kwa gaizie, nah ketsaime tsaidaidi kelakme tei eh ringcuh luzie, nah anui tsam dizie. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Kedanemene rimdi kerabe pumteih aide rimdi kelakbe de kailu maisia, nah tsaidi kerabe pumteih aide tsai kelakpe de kailu maisia. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Nah rimdi kerabe pumteih aide rimdi kelakbe kailude nah tsaidi kerabe pumteih tsaidi kelakbe kailude, iciu de Kesanglaisiu ga raupwa kelade teicang luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:54">“Ketsai de ngkap dida; ngkieng cangsiak luda.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa. 25:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Ketsai, daiga nang ngkiengkelu lano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Ketsai, daiga n tet lano?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hos. 13:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Dede ketsai tet au kemau, nah kemau kengkieng au hezai. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Dede anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade anuide ngkiengkelu kepeube Tinggwang de twa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:57 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rampaube Jisu Khrista gade anuide ngkiengkelu kepeube: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa tsaikegai gade, ketsai kengkieng de teingkapdi nah pa ringcuh daikelu gade herau de ngamlu. </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Ciziemne, kehung sinamedung, ntip bamlu nah nlai diso, Rampaube gade nnui ta tei kegaide kemta dila kemak ci eh Rampaube ta teinaang bammui lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:9">Gal. 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Tinggwang minadung ziemne hemakehekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Cu kemcimedung ziemne hemaa hekwa kecude ziemne: Ih Galatia ga ngqwadung dage rang kegai nzwa, nnuide cinzwa tei lulo. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Mtakkak gade tingbazie raitu benai msangne, nnui hangge ge kecu ngaukelu gade kesa keuntsam lwe hekwa lulo, iciude Ih kegwang dau, ma hekwa melu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Pecai Ih gwang lude, nnui ne kedet pwa kebamme dage Ih laisiu raugai eh penuide langgai zie, peu nnui mapeu Jerusalem ga pungmie kerane. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Nah Ih de mie kera tau dicai, penui acu nzang mie zie.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pe ziemne kiekegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Dede Ih Macedonia kahgwang kelu caine nnuida gwang zie, kedanemene Ih Macedonia kahgwang zielu. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Nah Ih nnuide ngngwa bamde cilak, mede tingtiak ting pelane bamdi de lubui, iciu eh Ih kehei ga kemie ga nnui acu a beuh ga nghalu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Kedanemene Ih cu nnuide kahgwang eh ngau kegai rünne neu ma, kedanemene Rampaube lungning liecai, Ih tingkak nage ziemne nnuide ngngwa bamkera reguibam. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Dede Ih Pentecost Ngyi cang kemaktane Ephesus ga bam zie, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />kedanemene kikam kedi nah keyi ge a ziemne ngkei pwabam dida, nah mina kekiee ge acu renia bam.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Cu Timothy gwangcai, peu pecu ngngidi mene nnuide ngngwa bamlu, kedanemene pa de Ih nzwa Rampaube ta teibam delu. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Ciziemne, peu migede de pecu cet helei diso. Dede peu pe lampui ga nciep eh gwanglu kerane pecu ngha lo, iciu eh pa ada gwanglu kerane, kedanemene pa kenlummedung de nzang gwanglu kera Ih regui bamlu. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Cu anui sinabe Apollos de anui sinamedung de ngngwa eh nnuida gwang lulo Ih rang sünne gaila, dede cu au pa gwang kera pe lungning ma. Ciude, pa peting keyi ngau lude pa gwang zie.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Mriak bamlu; kenlum ga sap ntiplu; kuu lu; ngking lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:10">Eph. 6:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Nah nnui tei kecu pelane de peu keku gade teilu.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Cu, sinamedung, nnui Stephanas nah pe kilungme ne, Achaia deuceu ga petsi raitube kecu cibam, nah penui kemcimedung ziemne bata keyi ketei ga penui lung kaisüt gai. Ih nnuide kecung sünne gaila, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />iciu eh nnui de mina aikenzwamedung, nah helungnei eh ngngwa heta teikebamme keheibe kangga bamlu kerane. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Ih Stephanas, nah Fortunatus, nah Achaicus penui kegwang ziemne a suiyi bam, kedanemene nnui lamde cang kemakbe penui kepeune; <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />kedanemene penui a sui nah nnui sui teimring gaibeu. Cine, mina aikenzwame dungde ci lulo.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Asia ga ngqwadung nnuide kelum gaila. Aquila nah Priscilla nah penai kiga ngqwame de Rampaube zi gade nnuide kelum sünne gaila. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Sinamedung pelane nnuide kelum gaila. Hangge ge de kemci kehemam teu eh kelum lulo.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Kelum kegai aide au Ih ne raugai—Paul. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Keheibe de Rampaube de keku gah cai, peu pecu reset punglu. Anui Rampaubo, gwang lulo!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anui Rampaubo, gwang lulo! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greekme led gade “Marana tha” dela. Aramiac kwa teukela kenlummedung aipau sam de penui kekie ga teu eh rangla. Amen, Hosana nah Hallelujah rangkela nzwa. </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Rampaube Jisu ngaugia de peu nnuida bam lulo. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Khrista Jisu gade a keku nnui pelane da peu bam kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>